{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 14:16:08", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-b4e963de-b188-4b3b-9212-523cfa878fd5', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 50, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': "CONTINUATION REQUEST:\n\nOriginal Task: CONTINUATION REQUEST:\n\nOriginal Task: Self-Improvement Task: Update model configuration for \n\n**Recommendation:** Cost optimization:  consistently succeeds\n**Description:** Agent  has 95.45% success rate. Consider using a cheaper/faster model to reduce costs.\n\n**Required Change:**\nUpdate the agent definition file for  to use the 'sonnet' model.\nThe model preference is in the ## Model Preference section of the agent's markdown file.\n\nAfter making the change:\n1. Verify the syntax is correct\n2. Update any related configuration if needed\n3. Report the changes made\n\nThis is a continuation of a previous session. The following work has already been completed:\n\n(No completed work summaries available)\n\nPlease review the existing work and continue from where the previous session left off.\nDo not restart from the beginning - identify remaining tasks and complete them.\n\nThis is a continuation of a previous session. The following work has already been completed:\n\n- leadership: Verified Executive Director agent is already configured with 'sonnet' model. No configuration changes required.\n\nPlease review the existing work and continue from where the previous session left off.\nDo not restart from the beginning - identify remaining tasks and complete them."}], 'model': 'claude-3-haiku-20240307', 'system': 'You are a title generator. Generate a concise 5-10 word title that summarizes the main task or goal in the user\'s prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY the title, nothing else\n- No quotes, periods, or other punctuation\n- Use action verbs when possible (Build, Create, Fix, Add, Implement)\n- Be specific but brief\n- If the prompt is about code, mention the technology/language if relevant\n\nExamples:\n- "Build user authentication with JWT tokens"\n- "Fix pagination bug in product listing"\n- "Add dark mode toggle to settings page"\n- "Implement real-time chat with WebSockets"\n- "Create REST API for user management"\n'}}"}
