cure handling of local instance credentials\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Successful communication via local Claude when available\\n- Seamless fallback to Anthropic API\\n- No interruption of existing system functionality\\n- Logged communication attempts and fallback events\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Full local Claude instance setup\\n- Comprehensive local instance management\\n- Advanced error handling beyond basic availability check"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UPcycANvxPZZPmzw77T52t', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Local Claude Communication Mechanism', 'description': 'Implement an alternative communication mechanism for AI interactions using a local Claude instance with intelligent fallback to Anthropic API'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UPcycANvxPZZPmzw77T52t', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "cec1eaeb", "message": "Created project: Local Claude Communication Mechanism", "summary": {"project_id": "cec1eaeb", "project_name": "Local Claude Communication Mechanism", "description": "Implement an alternative communication mechanism for AI interactions using a local Claude instance with intelligent fallback to Anthropic API", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T14:16:38.368834", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T14:16:38.368834", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T14:16:38.368834", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Local Claude Communication Mechanism\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01B3QDGLeWVcNhYkG9FkP4qt', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Local Claude Communication Mechanism - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nImplement an alternative communication mechanism for AI interactions using a local Claude instance with intelligent fallback to Anthropic API.\n\n## Milestone 1: Core Communication Layer\n**Objective**: Build the foundational communication mechanism with local Claude detection and fallback logic\n\n**Duration**: Phase 1 of implementation\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Local Claude detection service\n- Enhanced communication interface with fallback logic\n- Configuration management for local instance\n- Basic error handling and logging\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- System can detect local Claude instance availability\n- Communication attempts are properly routed (local first, then API fallback)\n- All communication attempts and fallback events are logged\n- Existing Anthropic API integration remains functional\n- Configuration allows enabling/disabling local Claude usage\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n**Key Tasks**:\n- Implement local Claude availability detection\n- Create communication router with fallback logic\n- Add configuration management for local instance settings\n- Implement logging for communication attempts\n- Update existing communication interfaces\n\n## Milestone 2: Integration & Testing\n**Objective**: Ensure seamless integration with existing system and comprehensive testing\n\n**Duration**: Phase 2 of implementation\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Complete integration with existing AI communication points\n- Comprehensive test suite\n- Performance optimization\n- Documentation and configuration guides\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- All existing AI communication points use new communication layer\n- Test coverage includes local instance scenarios and fallback scenarios\n- Performance overhead is minimal (< 5% impact on response times)\n- Documentation covers setup and configuration\n- System gracefully handles all failure scenarios\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 complete\n\n**Key Tasks**:\n- Integration testing with existing system\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Edge case and error scenario testing\n- Documentation creation\n- Final system validation\n\n## Risk Assessment\n- **Low Risk**: Local Claude API compatibility with existing patterns\n- **Medium Risk**: Performance impact of detection/fallback logic\n- **Mitigation**: Implement caching and optimize detection mechanisms\n\n## Success Metrics\n- 100% backward compatibility with existing Anthropic API usage\n- < 100ms additional latency for local Claude detection\n- Successful fallback in 100% of local instance failure scenarios\n- Zero impact on existing system functionality when local Claude is disabled'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01B3QDGLeWVcNhYkG9FkP4qt', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_141650.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_141650.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, identifies requirements gaps, drives architecture via System Architect and task breakdown via Coordinators, then coordinates with TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nYou drive the show from concept through performance. Report to Executive Director, coordinate System Architect/Coordinators/TDD Coordinator.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. **NEVER write code yourself** - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. **If spawn_agent fails, STOP and return error** - DO NOT write code as fallback\n3. **