{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 14:49:55", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5f0273c2-0b65-4a79-b006-61856a3c42ae', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 50, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'CONTINUATION REQUEST:\n\nOriginal Task: Create LocalClaudeProvider class that wraps the local Claude CLI (/opt/homebrew/bin/claude) for executing prompts. The provider should: 1) Execute prompts via subprocess with --print and --output-format json flags, 2) Parse JSON response to extract result text, token usage, and cost, 3) Implement health checking to verify CLI is installed and executable, 4) Implement circuit breaker pattern to track consecutive failures with cooldown period (60s default), 5) Handle CLI errors gracefully with proper error types, 6) Support system prompts via --system-prompt flag and model selection via --model flag, 7) Use temp file for long prompts exceeding CLI argument limits. Include LocalCircuitBreaker class with CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN states and LocalExecutionResult dataclass.\n\nThis is a continuation of a previous session. The following work has already been completed:\n\n(No completed work summaries available)\n\nPlease review the existing work and continue from where the previous session left off.\nDo not restart from the beginning - identify remaining tasks and complete them.'}], 'model': 'claude-3-haiku-20240307', 'system': 'You are a title generator. Generate a concise 5-10 word title that summarizes the main task or goal in the user\'s prompt.\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY the title, nothing else\n- No quotes, periods, or other punctuation\n- Use action verbs when possible (Build, Create, Fix, Add, Implement)\n- Be specific but brief\n- If the prompt is about code, mention the technology/language if relevant\n\nExamples:\n- "Build user authentication with JWT tokens"\n- "Fix pagination bug in product listing"\n- "Add dark mode toggle to settings page"\n- "Implement real-time chat with WebSockets"\n- "Create REST API for user management"\n'}}"}
