isting UI design"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_017mRy5Y8WwEyku28sZSJFH2', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Cost by Project Metric - Milestone Plan\n\n## Milestone 1: Foundation and Data Model (4-6 days)\n**Objective**: Establish core cost tracking infrastructure\n**Deliverables**:\n- Cost data models and schemas\n- Basic cost calculation engine\n- Integration with existing project tracking\n- Database schema updates\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Cost data can be stored and retrieved\n- Basic calculations work correctly\n- Integration points established\n- Unit tests for core functionality\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n## Milestone 2: Cost Management API (3-4 days)\n**Objective**: Create backend services for cost operations\n**Deliverables**:\n- REST API endpoints for cost CRUD operations\n- Cost aggregation and calculation services\n- Validation and error handling\n- API documentation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- All CRUD operations functional\n- Cost calculations accurate\n- Proper error responses\n- API tests passing\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 complete\n\n## Milestone 3: Dashboard UI (4-5 days)\n**Objective**: Build user interface for cost visualization\n**Deliverables**:\n- Cost dashboard component\n- Interactive charts and graphs\n- Cost breakdown views\n- Responsive design implementation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Visual cost representation works\n- Charts update in real-time\n- Mobile-friendly interface\n- Consistent with existing UI\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 complete\n\n## Milestone 4: Reporting and Export (2-3 days)\n**Objective**: Enable cost reporting capabilities\n**Deliverables**:\n- Report generation functionality\n- Export to CSV/PDF formats\n- Filtering and date range options\n- Print-friendly views\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Reports generate correctly\n- 