nt LocalCircuitBreaker class\\n- Support states: CLOSED, OPEN, HALF_OPEN\\n- Default cooldown period: 60 seconds\\n- Track consecutive failures\\n- Graceful error handling\\n\\n### Additional Features\\n- Health checking for CLI installation\\n- Support for system prompts via `--system-prompt`\\n- Model selection via `--model` flag\\n- Temp file handling for long prompts\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Reliable CLI interaction\\n- Robust error management\\n- Efficient resource utilization\\n- Flexible prompt handling"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_013QmVFyx2RXSsp3iHsUe4kw', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'LocalClaudeProvider Implementation', 'description': 'Implement LocalClaudeProvider with advanced CLI wrapping, circuit breaker, and execution result handling'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_013QmVFyx2RXSsp3iHsUe4kw', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "85842785", "message": "Created project: LocalClaudeProvider Implementation", "summary": {"project_id": "85842785", "project_name": "LocalClaudeProvider Implementation", "description": "Implement LocalClaudeProvider with advanced CLI wrapping, circuit breaker, and execution result handling", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T15:19:13.258210", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T15:19:13.258210", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T15:19:13.258210", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'LocalClaudeProvider Implementation\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01X8cXCwrfuT5vriNZZQ6cqH', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Dev